OL,3,GNEWSAGallows Corner opens after months
OL,4,Aof delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy flyover and roundabout linking
OL,7,Fthe capital with Essex has reopened to
OL,8,Ftraffic, Transport for London (TfL) has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FThe Gallows Corner flyover in Romford
OL,12,Fwas built as a temporary structure in
OL,13,Fthe 1970s and highways officials said
OL,14,Fit was in a very poor condition and
OL,15,Fneeded completely replacing.
OL,17,FConstruction began in March 2025 and it
OL,18,Fwas due to open in the spring.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
