OL,3,GNEWSAGallows Corner opens after months
OL,4,Aof delays
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We'd like to apologise to local
OL,7,Fresidents, businesses and road users
OL,8,Ffor the delays to these works and thank
OL,9,Fthem for their patience while this
OL,10,Fessential project has been carried
OL,11,Fout," said Stuart Harvey, TfL's chief
OL,12,Fcapital officer.
